# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS in your project.
#
# GitHub reads CODEOWNERS from the PR's base branch. With branch protection's
# "Require review from Code Owners" on (scripts/set-branch-protection.sh),
# any PR touching these paths needs the owner's approval whatever the
# workflows say. This is the backstop for a PR that edits its own checks.
#
# The owner must not be the identity agents push as: GitHub ignores an
# approval from the PR's author. See dev-pipeline docs/agent-identity.md.

/.github/          @HelpOnTheWay-bit
/.github/CODEOWNERS @HelpOnTheWay-bit
CODEOWNERS         @HelpOnTheWay-bit
AGENTS.md          @HelpOnTheWay-bit
CLAUDE.md          @HelpOnTheWay-bit
